<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Insert Name]</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">In order to meet a need of 12,000 blood donations per day to
preserve life for new mothers, children battling cancer, patients with sickle cell disease and those suffering
unexpected traumas, the American Red Cross needs partners like you to lead a
blood program. Your colleagues, employees, and </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background: yellow;">[vendors/clients/customers]</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;can also be
lifesavers—sustaining a healthy, ready blood supply for those in need. But the
rewards of service go far beyond even the profound benefit to patients. </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Sharing in community service offers unique
opportunities for <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Company Name]</span></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">.</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.1in; text-indent: -0.1in; line-height: normal;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">While your network is
helping save lives, the Red Cross offers the opportunity to demonstrate a
rewarding and visible contribution to the community through partnership with
one of the most trusted and recognized brands. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.1in; text-indent: -0.1in; line-height: normal;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Group volunteer
opportunities promote teamwork, boost employee morale and provide productive
social outlets.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.1in; text-indent: -0.1in; line-height: normal;"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Symbol; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">A great way to find and
cultivate new leaders within&nbsp;</span></font><b style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Company Name]</span></b><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;is through philanthropic endeavors. You’ll be surprised by the emergence of
leaders you never knew you had!<o:p></o:p></span></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Every two seconds, someone needs blood donated. While that’s
a daunting charge, you can make a big difference for those in need. </span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">For each blood donation your donors
provide, more than one life can be saved! </b><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Let’s work together to build
community, both at&nbsp;</span></font><b style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Company Name]</span></b><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;and in the far-reaching places your team’s unified effort can be felt. If you
can sponsor a blood drive program, please </span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">contact me at your earliest convenience to
schedule.</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Insert Name]</span></p>]]></td>
