<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">P.S.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">If you are unable to host an on-site blood drive, please visit&nbsp;</span><a href="https://sleevesup.redcrossblood.org/" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b><span style="color: red;">RedCrossBlood.org/SleevesUp</span></b></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;to host a virtual drive or&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">refer another host</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;today.</span>]]></td>
